1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,028
A, greater.

2
00:00:01,028 --> 00:00:12,838
Water vapour, with molar mass eighteen, is lighter than the nitrogen and oxygen it replaces, so moist air is less dense, and v goes as one over root rho.

3
00:00:12,838 --> 00:00:17,421
Many students guess slower, thinking wet air is heavier.

4
00:00:17,421 --> 00:00:19,036
It is the other way round.

